---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../assets/portrait.png";
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section id="about" title="About me.">
  <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-12">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p>
        Hey! I'm Diljit, a design enthusiast who became a frontend developer.
        I've explored visuals, editing and 3D projects. Eventually, I shifted
        my focus to creating functional web experiences.
      </p>
      <p>
        Now I concentrate on clean, interactive interfaces with some
        personality. I enjoy learning, no matter the challenge. I often break
        things just to improve them, and I'm always trying to pick up new tools
        or methods.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted">
        Whether the work is creative or technical, even a little messy, I'm
        open to trying it all.
      </p>
    </div>
    <Image
      src={portrait}
      alt="Portrait of Diljit Singh"
      width={160}
      height={160}
      densities={[1, 2]}
      class="size-32 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-line object-cover sm:size-40"
    />
  </div>
</Section>
